# SQLite & Databases
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal

# 误生成产物：把 SQLite 内存库 URI ":memory:" 当成了文件路径
# （aiosqlite/sqlite3 遇到 Path(":memory:") 会真的落盘一个名为 ":memory:" 的文件）
:memory:

